+\sum_{t<T}r_t(a_t;T)
+\ge
+\sum_{t<T}g(M_{t,T})-C T^{2/3}\sqrt{\log(T+2)}.
+\]
+For any fixed comparator \(a\),
+\[
+\sum_{t<T}a1\{a<M_{t,T}\}\le \sum_{t<T}M_{t,T},
+\]
