+## Probabilistic Method And Empirical-Process Background
+
+- Hoeffding (JASA 1963) is verified and is the direct concentration source for the iteration-10 grid-union-bound derandomization lemma. The proof only needs the standard bounded independent-sum tail inequality.
+- Alon and Spencer, *The Probabilistic Method* (Wiley, 4th ed. 2016), is verified as general background for proving existence by a random construction, union bounds, and Borel-Cantelli. It is not a delayed-market-making source.
